            "sid": "JER 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova avoora, “Avandu va Isiraeli, niiva mwenya kugirung'ana mugirung'ane muuzi ku inzi. Niiva muveeye avasuuvirifu ku inzi, kandi nimutulizaho ivifananyi viandunyira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gakaveeye amalungi munyi kwisuha, kulieta liange. Maku izihiiri ziosi zilandeva kuzigasiza, nazilanzizominya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
